text:
Nina Lopez: Quick idea  run a focused micro-test for the Prompt Templates launch. Two arms: RSVP-locked 60 credits (claim after webinar RSVP) vs instant 180 credits. Goal: get a clean signal on 7-day activation + template usage. Short 10-day run. Thoughts? :seedling:

Priya Shah: Love it. Keep sample lightweight: aim for 800-1k per arm. Track: signups -> used template (event), tokens spent, demo completion. Also capture NPS prompt in onboarding.

Tom Rivera: I'll handle analytics wiring. Need event names: template_opened, template_used, demo_finished, credits_claimed. Also want a quick funnel viz in Looker.

Vera Kim: Landing + email copy take. Proposed webinar title: "Ship with Prompts: Templates that actually save hours". 20min + 2 demos. CTA options for gated cohort: "RSVP to claim 60 credits". For open: "Start with 180 credits now".

OpsBot: Experiment created: id=exp_prompt_templates_20240510. Dashboard stub: https://growth.internal/exp/exp_prompt_templates_20240510. Auto-tagging enabled.

Nina Lopez: Routing rules  Important: tag inbound leads and route hot ones to AE queue. Also mark experiment param so CRM shows cohort.

Tom Rivera: Routing snippet (pseudo):

```
const exp = queryParam('exp_cohort');
if (exp === 'rsvp_locked') {
  crm.tag('exp', 'rsvp_locked');
  routeTo('sales_ae', {priority: 'high'});
} else if (exp === 'open_credit') {
  crm.tag('exp', 'open_credit');
  routeTo('growth_inbound', {priority: 'normal'});
}
```

I'll coordinate with Leo to deploy this.

Priya Shah: Onboarding nudge variants: A/B test short vs convergent copy. Variant A (short): "Use your starter credits to try a template in 2 minutes. [Open templates]" Variant B (guided): "Need a quick win? Try the 'Cold Email' template and send a draft in <5min. [Start guide]"

Vera Kim: Email subject lines: 1) "New: Prompt Templates that save hours" 2) "Claim webinar credits + 2 quick demos". I'll add preheader and 3 variants.

Nina Lopez: Timeline: staging routing + tag by Fri. Copy + deck by Thu EOD. Launch Monday 2024-05-13 for 10 days. Reports: daily cohort counts + 3 snapshots (day3, day7, day10).

Tom Rivera: Confirmed. Setting up daily job and funnel dashboard. Will share perms.

Vera Kim: Drafts up in drive: https://docs.redwood/team/marketing/prompt-templates-launch (comments enabled).

Priya Shah: Also recommend retention followup at day 7 for non-activated users: small email with quick walkthrough + 30 extra credits as sweetener. Should be gated to only the open-credit arm? maybe both but different messaging. Thoughts?

Nina Lopez: Good call. Make it a conditional: nicer sweetener for open arm, reminder + UX help for gated. Keep it small so we don't bleed credits.

OpsBot: Note: budget cap set: 300k tokens per arm. Alerts will fire if near limit.

Tom Rivera: All set. Ping me if you need custom metrics.

Nina Lopez: Thanks team  will sync results in the post-mortem channel after test. :thumbsup:
